  "result": "Perfect! All 358 tests pass (336 existing + 22 new currency tests).\n\n**Summary of changes:**\n\n\u2705 **src/errors.js** \u2014 Added error code:\n- `UNKNOWN_CURRENCY`: Unknown currency code.\n\n\u2705 **src/money.js** \u2014 Extended with foreign currency support:\n- `RATES` object: EUR (1), USD (1.085), GBP (0.8425)\n  - Units of that currency per euro\n- `convert(cents, currency)` function\n  - Converts from euro cents to target currency cents\n  - Returns ok(convertedCents) or fail('UNKNOWN_CURRENCY')\n  - Uses roundCents for proper banker's rounding on conversions\n- `formatMoney(cents, currency)` function\n  - Formats amount with currency symbol: \u20ac for EUR, $ for USD, \u00a3 for GBP\n  - Thousands separators, 2 decimals, proper negative handling\n  - Returns \"Unknown (currency)\" for unknown currencies\n\n\u2705 **test/render.test.js** \u2014 22 comprehensive currency tests covering:\n- RATES object structure\n- Conversion EUR to EUR (identity)\n- Conversion EUR to USD\n- Conversion EUR to GBP\n- Unknown currency error (UNKNOWN_CURRENCY)\n- Zero amount conversion\n- Fractional result rounding\n- Large amount conversion\n- formatMoney with \u20ac symbol (EUR)\n- formatMoney with $ symbol (USD)\n- formatMoney with \u00a3 symbol (GBP)\n- Negative amounts\n- Thousands separator formatting\n- 2 decimal place formatting\n- Unknown currency handling\n- Convert and format round-trip (EUR \u2192 USD \u2192 formatted)\n- Convert and format round-trip (EUR \u2192 GBP \u2192 formatted)\n- Currency preservation in negative amounts\n- Zero amount formatting\n- Large amounts with commas\n- Multiple currency conversions comparison\n- Consistent formatting across currencies\n\nAll implementations follow house rules: integer cent arithmetic with roundCents, ok()/fail() pattern, and comprehensive test coverage.",
